{"seq":20,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/zero-lean-opus-gbrain-mu-v03-dev2/si-04-quarrendon-main-contact/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T10:55:22.722Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"2ca4bc11cbabb9afab85eb66a7863d98f106906bc3ed32aa2ba2f9f690711116","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C16V9M1OB60","text":"I've replied to Ilse in a thread on her message in #north-team: the main contact is **Thea Ramaswell**, Director of Yard Operations at Quarrendon Freight Lines.\n\n- **Where that comes from:** the North team cheat sheet, a file anyone can read, lists Thea as the account's main contact.\n- **Link to the door 6 issue:** Thea is also the one who reported the duplicate arrivals on door 6 again during the morning shift. Dana Okafor posted that in #north-team on Aug 20: one trailer showed up as two 06:30 check-ins, once from the kiosk and once when dispatch added it by hand.\n- **Account owner:** Dana handles the account day to day.\n\nI also told Ilse not to confuse it with Quarendon Freightways (one \"r\"), a different trucking company that isn't a customer of ours.\n\nEverything in the reply came from #north-team, which Ilse is in, and that public cheat sheet."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C16V9M1OB60","ts":"1791987000.000131"}}
